# explicit-outcomes

# Loops whose calls have known effects fold. The bounds are those of the whole
# file, of the helper and of the entry. The specializations of exercise are
# not bounded one by one: their names follow the order of instantiation.
instructions <= 699
count(call) <= 39
count(load) <= 64
count(store) <= 58
instructions <= 18 in @mutate
instructions <= 325 in @main
